## top right quadrant

[ ] fx pads should be enabled only when applicable
    [ ] group selected (TwisterSendTracksToFxCtl)
    [ ] track in group selected (TwisterSendTrackToAllFxCtl)
    [ ] fxctl should be inactive when user selects a device
